  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First stable release. Render-time auto-linking for rich text and Markdown properties, keywords managed in their own backoffice section with page or external destinations, per-culture keyword sets, a dry-run audit with per-page and site-wide suppression, and dependency relations so Umbraco warns before a link target is deleted. Built and verified against Umbraco 17.6.1 on .NET 10.",
